    "retrievedAt": "2026-07-25",
    "documentRef": "Form Vat-8 — \"Seçme Hakkı ile Türk Vatandaşlığının Kazanılması Başvuru Formu\" (Acquisition of Turkish Citizenship by Right of Option Application Form), prescribed under Law No. 5901 on Turkish Citizenship, Article 21"
