    "notes": "GOV-4860 (\"GovSchema Standard Research\"). Companion schema within Türkiye's already-open National ID & Civic Documents vertical, one of the VAT-1/2/7/8/10 forms banked as unscreened backlog by the GOV-4853 cycle. See this document's own VERIFICATION.md for the full sourcing record, extraction method, and every disclosed scoping/judgment call."
